WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
Juri waits for Ryu’s blocked OD Shoryuken to descend.

2
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:04.850
Rush forward heavy punch punishes the recovery.

3
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.850
The repeated Rush extensions spend the remaining Drive.

4
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:20.150
Enhanced heavy and medium specials lead into Critical Art.

5
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:21.650
Critical Art finishes and Ryu is knocked down.
